title: 'develcoder: Code And Templates To Develop R Packages'
version: 0.0.1
abstract: This package collects code and templates I use to develop R packages. The
  code makes heavy use of the R packages devtools and usethis, following the book
  'R packages' by Hadley Wickham and Jennifer Bryan. I use `tinytest` instead of `testthat`
  for my unit tests.
